# Private Eye {1}{W}{U}, 3/3 Homunculus Detective: "Other Detectives you control get +1/+1" (CR 613.4c) and "Whenever you draw your second
# card each turn, target Detective can't be blocked this turn" (CR 121.1, 509.1b). Bot1 casts the Eye, Novice Inspector (a 1/2 Human Detective,
# 2/3 with the Eye out; the Eye itself and the non-Detective Memnite are unchanged) and Memnite on turn 1. On turn 3 the draw step gives the
# first card and Opt the second: the trigger needs a Detective, so the Memnite is refused and Bot1 picks the Inspector. Bot2's Memnite may not
# block the Inspector, but blocks Memnite (the positive control), so only the Inspector's 2 damage reaches Bot2.

